tps://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/755aecb4-8a5e-4875-b63f-f9d62c75d38b.jpg?im_w=240","id":"154101405"},"txt":"What an amazing place to stay with a spectacular view!! The beach out front is awesome and we saw turtles daily! Cynthia was great with communication and making our stay feel just like home. Hope to stay here again!!","_id":"6738cd7776b53ebe35369b26"},{"at":"2018-08-25T04:00:00.000Z","by":{"fullname":"Chris","imgUrl":"https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-570074090/original/4a25a900-e452-4772-933a-d42f1f0ae551.jpeg?im_w=240","id":"170664766"},"txt":"Fantastic unit. Amazing sunsets.","_id":"6738cd7776b53ebe35369b26"},{"at":"2018-09-13T04:00:00.000Z","by":{"fullname":"Esther","imgUrl":"https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/92fd9418-f506-44e3-9c60-c76d4199e3e5.jpg?im_w=240","id":"4059349"},"txt":"Enjoyed our stay very much! The condo was clean, spacious and with all the amenities of a home away from home. Cynthia was very responsive, even checking up on us when the tropical storm warnings went out. Thankfully, the storm didn’t dampen our stay. Enjoyed many beautiful Maui sunsets from the home!","_id":"6738cd7776b53ebe35369b26"},{"at":"2018-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","by":{"fullname":"Elaine","imgUrl":"https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a1e05883-caa7-4e05-85de-bcd480b7cebe.jpg?im_w=240","id":"73108150"},"txt":"The place has amazing ocean views!!! Cynthia provided beach chairs, gears, and toys for the kids. The entire condo is well organized and our family had such a great time. Appreciate all the little touches you provided for your guests. Will definitely stay there again when we return on Maui! :)","_id":"6738cd7776b53ebe35369b26"},{"at":"2019-01-11T05:00:00.000Z","by":{"fullname":"Dan","imgUrl":"https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d13665bb-181f-4e83-b37a-4d5695582e4c.jpg?im_w=240","id":"217281282"},"txt":"This condo was very spacious.  We had eight people (ages 5-85) and there was plenty of space for everyone.  Cynthia was readily accessible if we needed anything.  The view from the lanai was breathtaking and we watched whales every morning.  The condo was stocked with plenty of snorkel gear, boogie boards, beach chairs, sand toys for the kids, board games, puzzles, etc.  The kitchen had plenty of pots, pans, dishes, utensils, etc.  Thanks for the great stay!","_id":"6738cd7776b53ebe35369b26"},{"at":"2019-01-22T05:00:00.000Z","by":{"fullname":"Jess","imgUrl":"https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-570074090/original/4a25a900-e452-4772-933a-d42f1f0ae551.jpeg?im_w=240","id":"20450315"},"txt":"Very clean. Cleanest Airbnb we have stayed at. Beautiful home and beautiful view of the sunset from the apartment. Loved that they had binoculars to see the whales jumping out in the distance.","_id":"6738cd7776b53ebe35369b26"}],"likedByUsers":[],"availableDates":[{"start":"2025-02-28T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2030-12-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"labels":["Shepherd huts","Amazing","Beachfront"],"rating":"4.9","guestFavorit":false,"isGuestFavorite":false,"wishlist":[],"createdAt":"2024-11-16T16:37:32.000Z"} | {}
